    "findings": [
      "The JavaFML provider selects all matching mod-ID entrypoints, filters by actual physical side, and sorts common sides before a single side.",
      "The mod container loads only selected entrypoint classes and injects the same IEventBus into both authorized constructors.",
      "The common probe never references the physical-client class; it registers common indirection and client setup installs the callback.",
      "FMLPaths.GAMEDIR resolves the official launch game directory; fixture paths are fixed literal children.",
      "Both result files and temporary siblings plus release must be absent at setup. The server must not have client nonce input.",
      "First result creation rejects any existing target or symlink; failure may replace only a role result previously written by the current process. Private supervisor-owned profile roots remain a requirement.",
      "PASS phase and flow are encoded from actual IPayloadContext enum values after assertions, with a second closed-domain check before writing."
    ]
  },
